<title>UK: Next UK monetary meetings set for Sept 23, Oct 30.</title>
<headline>Next UK monetary meetings set for Sept 23, Oct 30.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-09-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>The next two monetary meetings between UK Chancellor of the Exchequer Kenneth Clarke and Bank of England Governor Eddie George will take place on September 23 and October 30, according to the minutes of the July 30 meeting.</p>
<p>Minutes for the meeting held on September 4 will be published on Wednesday October 9 at 0830 GMT.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom 44 171 542 2774</p>
</text>
